        "vid": "9eb2533e-4434-11f1-bb07-bc241121aa0a"
    },
    "details": "# Problem Description:\n\nThe BOOTP file field is written to the lease file without escaping\nembedded double-quotes, allowing injection of arbitrary dhclient.conf\ndirectives. When the lease file is subsequently re-parsed by dhclient,\ne.g., after a system restart, an attacker-controlled field from the\nlease is passed to dhclient-script(8), which evaluates it.\n\n# Impact:\n\nA rogue DHCP server may be able to execute arbirary code as root on a\nsystem running dhclient.\n",
